   * Removed mimage and Macintosh.exe from package (now a separate project)
   * Removed wine from dependencies (was only needed by mimage)
   * Changed Architecture from amd64 to all (pure Python)
   * Added mimage to Recommends
   * Updated debian/install, debian/postinst accordingly
